{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0xvc3QlMjBPbiUyMEElMjBNb3VudGFpbiUyMEluJTIwTWFpbmUlMjAlMjgyMDI0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Lost On A Mountain In Maine","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/elKEzHpbdoTMkK0IpUKcK6x1Ttl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q8blBwffuaexW9QMNC2Pa3wqgqM.jpg","description":"When twelve-year-old Donn Fendler gets tired of waiting for his father and brothers to join him on the summit of Maine's highest peak, he decides to find his own way back to camp. But Donn doesn't count on a fast-moving fog that obscures the path. He doesn't count on falling down an embankment that hides him from sight. And he doesn't count on taking a turn that leaves him alone to wander aimlessly for nearly two weeks in the empty mountain wilderness.","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Adventure","Drama","Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"115 min","cast":["Luke David Blumm","Paul Sparks","Caitlin FitzGerald","Ethan Slater","Griffin Wallace Henkel","Dean Neistat","Bates Wilder","Mason Cufari"],"director":["Andrew Kightlinger"],"released":"2024-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"80 miles. 9 days. 1 step at a time.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Luke David Blumm","character":"Donn Fendler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hGlbohMZC288scc3IYEcunqbkZg.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Sparks","character":"Mr. Donald Fendler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cQnCJI94lje55gZ7kEQ7YZUQPDb.jpg"},{"name":"Caitlin FitzGerald","character":"Mrs. Ruth Fendler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zwtbLjCsThiD4MlnELnYKzUKCqZ.jpg"},{"name":"Ethan Slater","character":"Henry","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xIgqyrM78FPt7Pb2Vv3IvJcnOWS.jpg"},{"name":"Griffin Wallace Henkel","character":"Ryan Fendler","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wx2gSdyNgpAYauTy24vPx9aJvxw.jpg"},{"name":"Dean Neistat","character":"State Trooper in Canoe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kxpdh3MKXci1K